## Secrets Policy Compliance

- [ ] No API keys, tokens, or passwords in source code
- [ ] `.env` file is listed in `.gitignore`
- [ ] `.env.example` with placeholder values exists in repo root
- [ ] All credentials documented as environment variables
- [ ] No private keys or certificates committed to repo

> **If any box is unchecked:** Fix before committing.
> Quick check: `git diff --staged | grep -iE "(key|secret|password|token)\s*="`

